WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:06.340
Are we searching for 
where the demons' leader is hiding now?

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.190
Yeah.

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.230
But how do we do it?

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.220
The enemy thought he could cut off 
our ability to find him

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.560
by destroying the relay in Elenia.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:19.200
But the transmission spell still carried a trace 
of the caster's magic signature.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.210
I've recorded that signature here.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.900
In a magistone? 
It can do that, too?

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:25.730
Yeah.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.040
And there's a device that enables the user 
to trace an enemy through a magistone.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.470
If we go to it, we can use it 
to pinpoint his location.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:35.730
I've never heard of such a device.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:39.180
Of course you haven't. 
It's from thousands of years ago.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.170
Thousands of years ago?!

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:45.540
But you know how to use it?

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.560
How?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.720
Because—

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.040
Well, I just kind of stumbled into it.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.520
<i>That was close.</i>

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.610
<i>I almost told them I created it!</i>

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:58.160
So, where is this device?

00:00:58.470 --> 00:00:59.660
Here.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.550
The Radinia Alliance?

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:06.230
Getting the king's help 
will make crossing the border smoother.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.590
If we ask the headmaster, 
I'm sure he'll probably mediate for us.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:13.550
The king and the headmaster 
are quite friendly, aren't they?

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:17.260
For now, let's get back to the capital.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:22.660
Hey! I'm still eating!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:58.030
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:58.030
<b>The Strongest Sage Duels.</b>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.530
We're back!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.280
It's been only a few days, 
but it feels as if we've been gone forever!

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:07.130
I hope everyone in Second Academy 
is all right.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:10.790
The school's gone...

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.750
Huh?!

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.750
This <i>is</i> where Second Academy was, isn't it?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.770
Of course it is!

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.470
What in the world happened?

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:25.460
"New Second Academy building, 
under construction"?

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:27.860
Headmaster!

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:29.560
Hey there, Matthias!

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:32.480
You're all back, eh?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.730
We beat up the demon 
in the dungeon city!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.340
Indeed you did. Excellent work!

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.190
But what's going on here?

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:44.380
As you can see, we're rebuilding the academy 
from the ground up.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:48.620
We're making the walls thicker 
and erecting a barrier to withstand demon attack.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:51.010
More of a fortress, then?

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:53.570
Where will they hold the classes?

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:55.130
First Academy.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.670
Their students are helping 
with the construction as well.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.360
And it'll be good casting practice for them.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.860
Good idea, don't you agree?

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:12.310
There was another demon pulling the strings 
in the dungeon city.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.880
In order to find him, 
I need to cross the border.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.520
I see. The border with whom?

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.280
The Radinia Alliance.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.020
That's a group of allied nations.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:27.520
Unfortunately, not all the nations are friendly.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.140
Would the king be willing to help?

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.110
Yes.

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:35.460
I'll make a recommendation 
to seek their Guild's cooperation.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.280
Thank you.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:40.850
Given that there are demons involved, 
I'm sure he'll make it his top priority.

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:44.590
While we wait for leave to travel, 
we'll help with the construction here.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.030
You will?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.270
You don't mind, do you?

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.300
Of course not!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.100
We'd appreciate the help.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.980
I wanna help, too!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:00.840
The pillars will be tougher 
if you use a mithril alloy instead of iron.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.130
I see!

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:06.270
Enchanting the building materials 
will make things more efficient!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.370
Here I go!

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:14.330
Hey, Iris!  
Don't bite off more than you can chew!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.480
I won't!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.740
Yeah, thought so.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.430
The king's granted permission.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.860
This contains your border-crossing permit

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.380
and the king's voucher 
for the Radinia Alliance.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:35.880
I appreciate this.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.810
We can't let the demons 
have free rein any longer.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.210
Get to it.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:42.220
We will.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.230
This is my first time 
leaving the Eis Kingdom!

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:49.950
What do you think 
the Radinia Alliance is like?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.490
I hope they've got tasty food!

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.450
Take care!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:59.250
Having His Majesty's recommendation 
let us pass right through!

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.690
The Radinia Alliance is just ahead.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.950
We're almost at our destination!

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:08.380
But now the problems start.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.590
A restricted region?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:15.230
Entry to the region containing the device 
is heavily restricted.

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:16.990
The magic signature there 
is likely so strong

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:20.060
that they're afraid 
a magical calamity will occur.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:23.510
Does that mean we can't get closer?

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:24.960
What do we do?

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:27.070
According to the information 
the headmaster gave us,

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.350
the only way is to increase 
our adventurer rank.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:34.520
We need to be Rank A 
to enter a restricted region.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.750
How do we increase our rank?

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:39.500
We head for the Radinia Adventurers' Guild

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.790
and complete the ranking test.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.960
What? But we have a voucher from the king!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.850
Yes, but we also have 
to follow the Guild's rules.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:52.890
But won't passing their tests 
take a whole lot of time?

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.960
If they force our hand, 
we'll have other ways to proceed.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.220
Like what?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.520
A darkness dragon appearing 
above a restricted region

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.300
would cause quite a panic, wouldn't it?

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.860
We'd use that as a distraction 
to reach our destination.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:08.960
Hey, I forgot I could turn into a dragon.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:09.960
You have it backwards!

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.410
You're a dragon 
who's turned into a human!

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:23.380
Wow, it's so different from the capital!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.340
Let's hit up the Adventurers' Guild first.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.210
Well, well!

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.550
Welcome!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:34.440
So you're the Matthias party 
I've heard so much about.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:35.390
You've heard of us?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:40.810
The king of the Eis Kingdom 
asked our Guild for help.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.230
He's urging international cooperation,

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.380
now that the demons 
are growing more active.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.540
That's our king!

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.500
I'm happy to help you 
as much as I can.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.070
Much appreciated.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:55.030
And you say you want 
to enter the restricted zone?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.360
Yes.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:08:00.040
So I'd like to reach Rank A 
as soon as I can.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.030
Can I take the ascension test?

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:03.440
Of course you can.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:08.140
I'd normally require you to start at Rank G, 
the lowest level there is.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:11.800
But I'll let you skip right 
to the Rank A test.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:14.760
I'm afraid that's the best 
we can offer you.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.520
Understood.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:21.070
But will we be all right, 
going right to the Rank A test?

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:24.140
What exactly does the test consist of?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:28.020
A mock battle with a prearranged proctor.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.720
He should be arriving any time now.

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.030
Did I keep you waitin'?

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:39.190
Giluas! What are you doing here?!

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:43.460
I'm the proctor for their ascension test.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.790
Y-You can't...!

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:47.910
<i>He has a powerful magical signature.</i>

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:51.530
<i>High enough that I might suspect 
he was a demon,</i>

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:53.620
<i>but he's definitely human...</i>

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:55.010
Who is this man?

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.330
You haven't heard?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:58.800
Have any of you?

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.390
No...

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.530
Is he famous in your lands?

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:05.020
He's a Rank S adventurer!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:05.980
"Rank S"?

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:10.580
Fighting is basically all he thinks about.

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:13.610
<i>Your average battle maniac, then?</i>

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.200
Branch Chief!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.990
You oughta know by now 
that I'm the real deal!

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:21.530
But you're not the one I called for!

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:23.000
What are you doing here?!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:28.480
The proctor you asked for ran off, 
bitchin' about some stomachache.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.460
What?!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:34.480
So I'm bein' real generous 
and offerin' to stand in.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.130
I don't mind.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.770
Let's begin the test.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:43.580
But no one's ever passed a test 
run by Giluas!

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:44.560
Really?!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:48.810
He's failed every previous applicant 
without even fighting them.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.320
Hey, that's mean!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.640
Shaddap!

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:57.360
It's 'cause they were all trash, 
not even worth fightin'!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:02.080
I got time only for the real strong guys.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.420
Intriguing.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.710
You first!

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:12.540
And you!

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:14.820
And you!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:15.920
Yes?

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.280
You all pass.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.640
That's it for the test. 
You can head on home.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.480
<i>What in the world?</i>

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.060
Now, you...

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.010
You'll fight me.

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:29.770
One on one.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.570
I've heard about you, Matthias.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:36.010
You're the heroic demon-slayer 
from the Kingdom of Eis.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:40.440
<i>I see. He just wanted 
to fight me from the start.</i>

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:42.740
I suppose you're on.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:47.160
We will now commence 
the Rank A ascension exam!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:52.210
The proctor, Giluas, 
will evaluate Matthias's skills in a mock battle!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.570
Been a while since I got 
to fight someone real strong.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:57.130
Can't wait to show my stuff!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:01.390
<i>Let's see what a Rank S fighter can do.</i>

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.620
He'll be okay, right?

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:07.570
It's hard to imagine 
Matty ever losing, but...

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:10.620
Giluas is a combat prodigy.

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:13.520
It's said he's never lost a duel.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:15.980
He's that good?

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:17.940
What are our rules here?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:22.740
Match is over when one of us 
gets knocked out or gives up.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:23.930
Very well.

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:29.140
I don't use magic, 
but you can if you want.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.040
You don't use magic?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:36.850
<i>Given his magical signature, 
I'd pegged him as a spellsword like me.</i>

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:38.510
Are you holding back on me?

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.410
'Course not.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:43.110
This ain't some handicap 
I'm givin' you.

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:45.760
I just never use magic.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:46.970
What's that?

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:50.650
This is all I use!

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:52.700
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:55.240
<i>A physique enhancement spell...</i>

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:59.150
<i>But I don't think Giluas is lying.</i>

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.630
I'm ready.

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:02.900
Come at me any time!

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:05.870
Don't mind if I do!

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.080
<i>Enhance Physique!</i>

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.800
<i>He's definitely using 
an Enhance Physique spell.</i>

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:19.050
<i>But he doesn't even realize 
he's casting it.</i>

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.650
<i>Is he just using it instinctively?!</i>

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:25.390
Just what I'd expect 
from the heroic demon-slayer!

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.640
An attack like that 
don't even faze you, huh?!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.670
Looks like this'll be a pretty fun fight!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:41.360
<i>He's mixing in other enhancement spells 
like Enhance Fortitude and Sunder Steel.</i>

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:48.400
<i>Most humans can't cast spells unconsciously.</i>

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.760
<i>Yet he's doing it perfectly, 
without a moment's thought...</i>

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.430
<i>Incredible.</i>

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.620
Awesome! 
He's matching Matty blow for blow!

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:01.810
He really is!

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:04.380
I never thought I'd find a man 
on equal footing with Giluas...

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:10.390
Hey, you ain't holdin' back, are you?!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.380
<i>Good instincts.</i>

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:14.520
Yes, I certainly am.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.760
Oh, yeah?

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.270
Well knock it off already!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.860
If you want to see what I can really do,

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:21.650
I'll show you!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.000
Sounds good to me!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.620
I'll make you get serious!

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:34.930
<i>Giluas's magic power is growing stronger?!</i>

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:38.030
<i>His casting is improving even as we fight.</i>

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:39.790
<i>His instincts are incredible.</i>

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.180
I ain't never fought anyone

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:46.010
who got my heart racing like this before!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:51.260
<i>I'll bet he's never fought anyone 
better than him.</i>

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:56.500
<i>Now that he's hitting a wall, 
it's increasing his combat instincts.</i>

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.980
<i>It's the height of foolishness 
to leap that high without magical enhancement.</i>

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:06.030
<i>He's just making himself vulnerable 
until he lands.</i>

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:08.150
Watch this!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:12.670
Is that...

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:14.830
He's fighting the way Matty does!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.330
<i>He learned how I fight...</i>

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.270
<i>After seeing only it once...</i>

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.680
<i>He adapts that quickly?</i>

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.630
Here we go!

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.360
How'd you like that?!

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:44.040
A strike combining Enhance Physique 
and the gravity of a long fall...

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:48.780
An ideal fighting style if you want 
to force your way past the opponent's guard.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:52.570
But your casting strength 
is entirely insufficient.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.060
What'd you say?

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.410
That was the best attack I can—

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.100
Want to keep going?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.480
I give.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.950
The winner is Matthias! 
He passes!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.940
Yeah!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.260
Is that a successful dispatch?

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:31.990
He didn't dispatch anyone!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:36.450
That's the first time I ever lost.

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:39.960
But your skills are incredible.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:44.360
Tell me! 
How do I get as strong as you?!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:46.000
That's a good question...

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:49.130
Read this.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.420
Matty. What's that?

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.220
It's a textbook I wrote.

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:56.000
A textbook?

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.850
You wrote one of those?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:01.460
What you lack is knowledge 
of spell casting.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:04.840
You might surpass me 
if you put in the work,

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.420
but you have the talent, either way.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.110
You makin' fun of me?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:12.250
I'm completely serious.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:15.050
If you internalize 
what's written in that book,

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:17.120
you'll definitely grow stronger.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:20.700
And spell castin' is supposed 
to help me out in combat?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.240
It certainly will.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:26.210
But chantin' spells leaves a guy 
open for ages.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.630
You didn't cast any, either.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:30.460
But I did!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:34.340
You don't need incantations to cast spells.

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:36.030
Really?

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:38.960
You're actually casting spells unconsciously.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.970
To enhance your physique and such.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.360
I am?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:46.370
If you start to do it consciously, 
you can get even stronger.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:49.390
Awright! 
I'm gonna read the heck outta this!

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:57.060
It ain't stickin', man!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.820
You got a spell to make me 
better at readin'?

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:05.350
Tryin' to read 
gives me a big damn headache.

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:10.060
The healing spell on page 132 
works well on headaches.

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:21.680
You really ain't gonna go for Rank S?

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:23.390
I'll pass.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:25.360
Shame.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:28.990
You could be the strongest 
in the land, for sure.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:33.740
We just needed Rank A 
to enter restricted territory.

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:35.990
What restricted territory?

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.750
The Etelis Plains in the Folkia Region.

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:41.450
Folkia, huh?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.210
Does that mean something to you?

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:46.960
Nah, I just hear 
the city's got a weird vibe.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.290
What do you mean?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.960
I hear the atmosphere there
 has changed a lot lately.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:56.170
Checkpoints along the nearby roads 
have grown stricter all of a sudden, too.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:18:00.760
And I hear parties have gone missing 
on the way there.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:04.110
So if crap goes down, just lemme know!

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:06.020
I'll help out.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:07.440
I appreciate that.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:14.990
Is this one of the checkpoints 
he mentioned?

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:18.380
Seems pretty normal to me, but...

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:21.350
Halt. Papers, please.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.180
Where are you headed?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.000
I'm here on adventurer work.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:31.060
Each of you, take one of these passes.

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:34.860
They're valid only for the main road, 
though, so be careful.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.260
Understood.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:40.370
That was easier than I expected!

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.660
I don't know why we were so nervous!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.480
I wanna hit that city fast.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:48.430
No, there's still trouble ahead.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:53.080
There's a magical code 
inscribed in these passes.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.150
"A code"?!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:02.160
"Caution. 
Party of four high-rank adventurers."

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:05.300
"Motives questionable. 
Deal with immediately"?!

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:06.600
What do they mean by "deal with"?

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:08.290
The content doesn't matter.

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:14.270
What matters is that the coding technology 
is the same as the one the demons use.

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:15.160
What?!

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:19.130
But those guards weren't demons, were they?

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.130
No, they were human.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:26.620
But to set up checkpoints, 
you need to hold local power.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:31.140
Then if the checkpoint 
is using demon coding technology...

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:35.150
All of Folkia might be 
under the demons' control?!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.900
It seems entirely possible.

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:38.860
Look.

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:41.930
We have visitors already.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:45.190
Probably someone's hired goons...

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:49.520
They're out to finish us off 
before we reach the city.

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:53.250
And Giluas mentioned parties going missing.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.980
I suppose this is what he meant.

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:57.750
You want us to stamp 'em out?

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:00.210
No, that wouldn't be good.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.110
We'll put them all to sleep instead.

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.410
To sleep?

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.580
We can't just beat them?

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.880
If they put up a fight 
and raise a commotion,

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:09.810
it could make 
infiltrating the city harder.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.610
Iris and I will draw their attention.

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:14.170
Lurie, Alma.

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:16.250
Get around behind them

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.190
and use this magic item 
to put them to sleep.

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:19.480
Understood!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.820
We will!

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.750
What are these?

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.160
I used a spell to create illusions.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:31.680
From a distance, 
they should look convincing enough.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.120
All right, let's begin!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:38.750
We're under attack! Be careful!

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.590
Looks like they saw us.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:43.540
Better get started.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:44.700
Get 'em!

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.010
Yeah!

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:50.390
Now, let's have a bit of fun!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.800
That's what I like to hear!

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:55.600
Ow!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:56.810
Ow, ow, ow!

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.690
The arrows don't hurt her?

00:20:58.690 --> 00:20:59.820
What's going on here?!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.590
Darn you...

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.730
This is so annoying!

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:09.160
Why did you do that?

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:12.750
If you run in, 
someone's definitely going to die!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:15.960
Oh, right. 
We're just putting them to sleep.

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.810
Great! They haven't noticed us!

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:24.050
Let's activate the magic item now!

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:30.930
Wh-What the...

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:33.310
Damn! I can't see anything!

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:36.660
Gettin'... sleepy...

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:40.350
That was perfect.

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.190
He's fast asleep, huh?

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:46.040
Where are Lurie and Alma?

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.900
Good question.

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:53.870
They're asleep.

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:29.520
This is Matty's handwritten textbook?

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:31.300
Let me see!

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:33.910
It's good to be studious!

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:36.810
Sh-She's asleep...

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.080
She just wanted it for a pillow?

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Episode 10 
The Strongest Sage Works With a Team.</b>
